  "releaseNotes": "v1.5.0 - Automatic AOT Registration & Swashbuckle 10+ Synergy 🛡️\n    - Automatic Registration: No more manual/partial method calls. Validators are registered via [ModuleInitializer].\n    - Swashbuckle 10.x Support: Native compatibility with Microsoft.OpenApi v2.0 for modern .NET 10+ environments.\n    - Zero-Config Generator: Generator automatically activates when AddSannr() is detected in your code.\n    - Enhanced OpenAPI Schemas: Fixed Range (Min/Max) mapping for v2.0 schemas.\n    - Clean Build: Resolved IDE formatting warnings and updated documentation for a crisp developer experience.",
